# Pharmora

Premium multi-tenant pharmaceutical SaaS. Demo tenant is Laboratory & Allied (Kenya) via config — never hard-code the whole app around LabAllied.

## Source of truth

Read `docs/pharmora/PROGRESS.md` first. Then only the doc needed for the current phase. Do not re-scan the whole repo, `node_modules`, or build output.

- Product: `docs/pharmora/PRODUCT.md`
- Design: `docs/pharmora/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`
- UX: `docs/pharmora/UX.md`
- Architecture: `docs/pharmora/ARCHITECTURE.md`

## This phase of the company roadmap

Frontend + UX + design system + mock data only. No backend, database, production APIs, real auth, OpenAI/WhatsApp/ERP/payments, secrets, or fake production login.

## How to work

- One phase at a time. Do not skip ahead or rebuild completed work.
- Reuse components. Tokens in CSS variables. Mock data centralized when pages exist.
- Quality over speed. No lorem, no medical advice, no fake clinical claims.

## Phase order

1. Repo + docs  
2. Tokens, typography, base UI  
3. App shell, nav, search, command palette  
4. Dashboard  
5. AI Assistant  
6. Products  
7. RFQs  
8. Customers  
9. Quotes + Orders  
10. Documents  
11. Analytics  
12. Distributor portal  
13. Public `/ask`  
14–17. Responsive, motion, a11y/perf, visual QA  

Update `PROGRESS.md` after each phase.
